[Music]  verne troyer has died he was 49 the  actors team took to Instagram to share  the sad news with fans writing in part  it is with great sadness and incredibly  heavy hearts to write that Vern passed  away depression and suicide are very  serious issues you never know what kind  of battles someone is going through  inside earlier this month  multiple outlets reported Vern was  placed on a 5150 hold following police  being called out to his home after  allegedly being told he was suicidal  Vern was best known for his role as  mini-me in the Austin Powers franchise I  shall call him mini-me and in a  statement to ET mike myers who starred  alongside Vern  paid tribute to his former co-star Vern  was the consummate professional and a  beacon of positivity for those of us who  had the honor of working with him it is  a sad day but I hope he is in a better  place he will be greatly missed other  stars took to social media to share  their condolences and fond memories of  the actor rapper Ludacris shared this  throwback from his 2005 Austin Powers  themed music video for number one spot  which Byrne starred in while Shannon  Elizabeth posted a sweet photo with  Troyer  tweeting rest in peace and fly with the  Angels Vern  [Music]

